      "cooked": "<p>I chose for Haka to Crush the Abject Refugees in the Dok'Thorath Capitol, placing them under Savage Mana so that he could deal damage to Shu.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sorry about your plight, refugees!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Know that your destruction serves the greater good by having Haka&nbsp;chew you&nbsp;up and spit you&nbsp;back out on the enemy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The heroes will tend to your needs next time, I promise.</p>",
